[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13864.15, "timestamp": "03:51:04", "text": "当你像我一样拥有权利时，你就会享有这些权利。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13866.469, "timestamp": "03:51:06", "text": "我去。我去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13868.309, "timestamp": "03:51:08", "text": "如果你们不了解这种动态的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13870.95, "timestamp": "03:51:10", "text": "图像意味着，这意味着他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13873.67, "timestamp": "03:51:13", "text": "它是一位领主。那个玩家简直就是个大人物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13875.63, "timestamp": "03:51:15", "text": "而“主”的意思就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13877.15, "timestamp": "03:51:17", "text": "那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13880.71, "timestamp": "03:51:20", "text": "基本上你已经花了这么多钱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13888.469, "timestamp": "03:51:28", "text": "特点。我们不能要三份吗？你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13902.55, "timestamp": "03:51:42", "text": "第一轮。我绝不会允许任何人受苦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13912.63, "timestamp": "03:51:52", "text": "我可以打字。什么？哦，还有他"}]